# This directory is bind-mounted into Alloy and read by its textfile collector.
#
# It has to exist in git. Docker creates a missing bind-mount source owned by
# root, and the benchmark then cannot write its samples into it as the runner
# user -- the write is swallowed, and the dashboard is empty for no visible
# reason. Keeping the directory here means git creates it with the right
# ownership on every checkout, on the runner as well as on a laptop.